{{Item|Gold Essence}} is an [[Essence]]. It is primarily used in the {{Zone|dwarven mines}}.

== Obtaining ==
{{Item|Gold Essence}} can be be obtained in the {{Zone|dwarven mines}}, {{Zone|crystal hollows}}, and the [[Catacombs]] in multiple ways:
* Opening [[Crystal Hollows#Treasure and Loot Chests|Crystal Hollows Treasure Chests]].
* Completing the [[Crystal Nucleus]].
* [[Dungeon Secrets|Dungeon Secret Chests]]
* Killing [[The Watcher|Watcher Undeads]] with the '''Golden''' modifier in the [[Catacombs]].
* [[Salvaging#Gold|Salvaging]] certain items and items upgraded with {{Item|Gold Essence}}.
* Unlocking [[Golden Heads]] in Boss Collections.
* Unlocking {{NPCSprite|Marigold}}'s Shop.
* Trading with {{NPCSprite|Gold Forger}} and {{NPCSprite|Marigold}} visitors in {{Zone|The Garden}}.
